# Walkthrough - Core Advisory Integration

I have updated the Services page with a high-level "Asesoría y Consultoría" section that highlights SIPRAC's core technical strengths with a modern, corporate aesthetic.

## Changes Made

### 1. New "Asesoría y Consultoría" Section
- **Component**: Created [components/services/CoreAdvisory.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/services/CoreAdvisory.tsx).
- **Content Integrated**:
    - **Sistemas de Gestión Integrado (SGI)**
    - **Registro Único de Contratistas (RUC)**
    - **Gestión Ambiental**
    - **Seguridad y Salud en el Trabajo (SST)**
    - **Plan estratégico de seguridad vial (PESV)**
- **Design Highlights**:
    - **Metallic-Glass Grid**: The services are presented in a 3-column grid (responsively adjusting to 2 and 1) with liquid-glass transparency.
    - **Enhanced Interactivity**: Each card includes a "light sweep" effect and an icon that changes to orange on hover.
    - **Clear Hierarchy**: High-contrast typography and uppercase headings ensure maximum readability and a premium feel.

### 2. Services Page Layout Update
- Positioned the new [CoreAdvisory](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/services/CoreAdvisory.tsx#39-86) section immediately after the Hero section in [app/services/page.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/app/services/page.tsx), providing a strong professional introduction before diving into specific service details.

## Verification Results

### Automated Tests
- Ran `npm run build` which completed with **Exit Code 0**, confirming perfect integration and type safety.

### Visual Audit
- The new section provides a professional, "executive" summary of SIPRAC's consulting areas, ensuring potential clients immediately understand the breadth of expertise.
